╭─ Root command ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ sudo bash deploy/install/root.sh apply --user u \                            │
│   --staged /srv/state/host.env.staged                                        │
│                                                                              │
│ Installs tmux jq with apt, creates /var/lib/aacpanel, installs the collector │
│ unit and enables linger. Nothing else runs as root.                          │
